        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for Mid North, Mount Lofty Ranges, Murraylands and Upper South East forecast districts</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures, rain and showers and southwesterly winds are expected during Sunday. Areas likely to be affected include parts of the Mount Lofty Ranges, Mid North, Murraylands and Upper South East forecast districts. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
